      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven-look fabric; exact fiber composition was not available in the supplied evidence.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> One coordinated short-sleeve shirt for children and adults, ready for family photos, vacations, celebrations, and relaxed warm-weather plans.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Coastal Banana Leaf layers vivid blue and green banana and tropical leaves with slim orange botanical accents over a white ground.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Collared neckline, button-up front, short sleeves, and one shared print across child and adult sizes. The white undershirt and hanger shown are styling or display pieces only and are not included.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Follow the garment care label. Exact washing instructions were not available in the supplied evidence.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 4 Years through Child 14 Years and Adult M through Adult 5XL.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Button-Up Shirt Size Chart</h3>\n\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n\n<thead><tr>\n\n<th>Size</th>\n\n<th>Age</th>\n\n<th>Weight (kg)</th>\n\n<th>Height (cm)</th>\n\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm)</th>\n\n<th>Sleeve (cm)</th>\n\n<th>Pant/Short (cm)</th>\n\n<th>Hip (cm)</th>\n\n<th>Waist (cm)</th>\n\n<th>Garment Length (cm)</th>\n\n</tr></thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>12.5-20</td>\n<td>95-110</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>15-25</td>\n<td>110-120</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>20-27.5</td>\n<td>120-130</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>25-32.5</td>\n<td>130-138</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>30-35</td>\n<td>138-145</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 12 Years</td>\n<td>11-12</td>\n<td>32.5-40</td>\n<td>145-150</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 14 Years</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>35-42.5</td>\n<td>150-155</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult M</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>42.5-52.5</td>\n<td>155-165</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult L</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>52.5-60</td>\n<td>165-175</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>60-65</td>\n<td>165-178</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 2XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>65-72.5</td>\n<td>168-180</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 3XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>72.5-82.5</td>\n<td>170-180</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 4XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>82.5-90</td>\n<td>170-182</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 5XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>90-100</td>\n<td>170-185</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Coastal Banana Leaf brings a breezy tropical palette to family matching with a crisp white base, overlapping blue and green leaf shapes, and slim orange botanical accents. The open-collar button-up silhouette makes the print easy to style over a plain undershirt or wear on its own for coordinated vacation days and family portraits.</p>\n\n<p>The supplied chart provides recommended body height and weight only; chest, sleeve, pant or short, hip, waist, and garment-length measurements are unavailable and remain marked as such. It publishes one shared child-and-adult size ladder rather than separate girl, boy, mom, and dad measurements, so the picker uses honest Child and Adult labels without inventing role-specific variants.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n<strong>One coordinated shirt:</strong> The same collared short-sleeve button-up look is offered across child and adult sizes.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Distinct tropical print:</strong> Blue and green banana and tropical leaves, a white ground, and slim orange botanical accents create a photo-ready family palette.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Easy warm-weather layer:</strong> The relaxed button-up shape works over a simple undershirt or as a standalone top.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Wide size ladder:</strong> Seven child rows and seven adult rows are preserved from the supplied chart.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed variants:</strong> Every selectable size corresponds to one supplied chart row, with unavailable measurements left unguessed.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the child and adult sizes you need to create a coordinated Coastal Banana Leaf look for the next sunny family memory.</p>",
